    <string name="floating_title">Floating translator</string>
    <string name="floating_enable">Show the floating bubble</string>
    <string name="floating_subtitle">A small draggable button that stays on top of other apps so you can translate without switching away.</string>
    <string name="floating_permission_title">Why this needs permission</string>
    <string name="floating_permission_body">Android requires the "display over other apps" permission for anything that draws on top of another app. Haryanvi AI uses it only to show the bubble and its translation panel. It does not read what is on your screen, and it cannot see other apps\' contents.</string>
